<Layout title="Start Puff Collab">
  <h1>Start Puff Collab</h1>
  <p>Puff Collab currently runs from source. Install Git, Node 24, and <a href="https://viteplus.dev/guide/">Vite+</a>, then build the native desktop app.</p>
  <pre><code>git clone https://github.com/uzgorenm/puffcollab.git
cd puffcollab
vp i
vp run build:desktop
T3CODE_HOME="$HOME/.puffcollab" vp run start:desktop</code></pre>
  <p>Keep the terminal running while using the app. Authenticate a coding provider, add a local project, and create a thread to start working.</p>
  <p>There is no packaged Puff Collab installer yet. The upstream app-store listings and T3 Code installers are separate releases.</p>
  <a class="action" href="https://github.com/uzgorenm/puffcollab#readme">Read setup, hub linking, and team usage</a>
</Layout>
